Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Does the 04:15 Clear the Trestle?
- Story & Context: Before the morning lanterns were lit across the produce skiffs of Old Chula Depot, Grandmother Maeve dropped her heavy cast-iron skillet directly onto an idling reel-to-reel deck, sending an arc of blue sparks into a bank of overdriven tube amps. The resulting shriek of raw feedback coincided with the ground-shaking horn of an approaching timber train, prompting Maeve to raise her tarnished French horn and blast an echoing, modal dirge straight into the morning damp. Skiff vendors paused their bargaining as the sheer weight of low-end fuzz rippled the canal water and rattled crates of citrus, cementing the moment their dawn trading turned into a heavy wall of sound. Above the thunderous half-time pulse of distorted slide guitars, Maeve leaned into her auction mic and barked, "The railhead is sinking, but the diesel still breathes."
